WEBVTT

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:07.220
They say that the Tribe of Silver
has helped many tribes in the past

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:10.720
and brought about prosperity to the universe.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.930
So why?

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:18.520
Why do they wish for
destruction only for us humankind?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.480
We don't know what they're thinking,

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:27.280
their objectives, or even
what kind of life they're living.

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:32.700
Their emotions are leading them, Rom Ror.

00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:38.880
I don't think there's any
hidden power in the planet at all.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.090
Emotions...

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:44.210
Something precious...

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.260
Don't you have that yourself, Yuty?

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:55.600
<b>Tooku kirameku hoshi ni ikudo mo watashi wa negau</b>

00:00:55.690 --> 00:01:01.820
<b>Samayoeru kodou gravitation hikareau story</b>

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:21.880
<b>Hajimari wa itsukara owari wa nanbito shirazu</b>

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:29.130
<b>Mayakashi demo maboroshi demo naku sakaraenu nagare</b>

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:31.010
<b>(Kurai)</b>

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:36.270
<b>Yami ni sumishi mamono</b>

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:37.940
<b>(Blight)</b>

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.730
<b>Tayasuku nomikomareru youni watashi wa</b>

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.230
<b>(Eiyuu wo motomu)</b>

00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:45.860
<b>Mezame arugamama</b>

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:54.700
<b>Arishi yume ni arasoi wa tsukimono to kami ga iunara</b>

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:59.710
<b>Kono mi kirisaite demo looking for</b>

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:08.550
<b>Hana wo mune ni ugokidashita kodou wa dare nimo can't stop</b>

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:12.680
<b>Fureau ga sadame</b>

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:02.480
Concentrate the firepower on one spot!
Blast a hole in their defenses!

00:03:09.070 --> 00:03:12.990
Keep close watch on the distance
between ally ships so the enemy can't cut in.

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:15.070
We can't afford to get
separated from the others now.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:16.700
Roger.

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:17.740
Where's Belcross?

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.080
He just passed the asteroid belt,
heading towards the ant heaps.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.800
What's the Tribe of Silver up to?

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:40.220
Neither the Tribe of Silver's fleet nor any
Nodos have been spotted within the search range.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:45.100
They still haven't shown up? What's going on?

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:05.120
Belcross is fighting.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:07.130
Without any hesitation.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.580
Belcross destroyed six ant heaps!

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.250
Follow our Nodos!

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.010
Wipe out those disgusting ants!

00:04:53.090 --> 00:04:56.130
Our victorious moment is near...

00:04:56.220 --> 00:04:59.680
The Federation fleet has breached
the enemy's defensive line completely!

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:02.260
The damage to the fleet is
approximately two percent.

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:10.110
Switching to the planet-neutralizing formation
has been suggested. Our position is AE86.

00:05:10.190 --> 00:05:14.320
Position AE86. We're changing course.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:16.820
We're not getting enough resistance...

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:20.070
Why are we so one-sidedly...

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:50.480
We'll smash you!

00:05:56.070 --> 00:05:58.950
Maybe it's too difficult to deal
with that many of them all at one time.

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.990
But maybe it saves us a lot of time.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.460
Tail! Mail!

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.680
What's next?

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:28.730
This sensation is...

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:34.610
The shield is broken!

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:35.070
Begin emergency evasive maneuvers!
Ignite thruster F!

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:37.860
Evade! Evade!
 Begin emergency evasive maneuvers!
Ignite thruster F!

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.370
They came teleporting
out with all the ant heaps?!

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:54.960
Azmitral has been hit! No response from them!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.250
Straighten the attack formation and
concentrate firepower on point S45.
 Charging of the main cannons completed.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:57.380
Receiving markers. After entering the data,
we'll send it to the units in the rear.
 Charging of the main cannons completed.

00:06:57.460 --> 00:07:00.010
Watch out for ally fleets' evasive maneuvers.
 Organ units at the front moving to the back.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:02.510
We don't need any friendly fire accidents!
 Offensive fleets from 7 to 35
are now moving to the front.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:06.050
Damn, our strategy to keep a
close formation backfired on us?

00:07:43.970 --> 00:07:47.720
Th-This level of exhaustion is nothing!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:52.270
We're the ones to judge that.
Please lie down, like a good patient.

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.830
They're so many of them!

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:12.950
No kidding! This is endless!

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:16.460
I'll get them all at one time.

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:21.630
Eat this!

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:33.180
What's going on?

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:36.270
Although the Tribe of Bronze is
attacking us at the risk of their own lives,

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:39.650
I don't see any Nodos, not
even the Tribe of Silver's ships...

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:48.070
I wonder if the Tribe of Iron
determined that attacking a planet like Tauron

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:51.410
was a part of the Nodos' agreement.

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:55.410
Probably so, if that's what they wish.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:59.880
I can't help thinking that the Tribe of Gold
giving a Nodos to the Tribe of Iron

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:05.420
only left an unnecessary reason to fight.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:13.470
The Tribe of Gold left the Nodos so that it
could play some unknown role in our universe...

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:15.680
That's what I think.

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:19.850
The Nodos exists to play a role?

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:27.530
That's right... And I imagine that's
exactly what the Tribe of Gold wanted.

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.790
Shield energy output ninety percent.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:41.040
The shield is going to reach its limits soon.

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:44.840
I wish we could get a little closer,
but it can't be helped.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.720
All fleets, begin firing!

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:14.240
Belcross has destroyed the twelfth ant heap!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:19.160
The Azz-Azoth Fleet has destroyed one also.
There are two more ant heaps left!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:23.210
We have basically destroyed the
enemy's defensive line, Big Brother!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:26.460
Invade Tauron's gravitational field!

00:10:26.550 --> 00:10:31.510
Show how courageous the
Calydonian Fleet is to the whole universe!

00:10:31.590 --> 00:10:33.680
Charge!

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:47.030
The Althaia is picking up
speed and getting closer to Tauron.

00:10:47.110 --> 00:10:49.440
Those fools are too eager for success.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:53.240
They're mistaking isolating
themselves for taking the lead.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:58.500
However, the Althaia is still officially the
flagship of the Federation fleet, ma'am.

00:10:58.580 --> 00:11:02.170
I know that. We have no
choice but to invade as well.

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:05.340
We'll make the satellite fortress
control the remaining ant heaps.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:08.170
It's no fun to be shot at from above.

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:09.550
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:11.590
They sure give us a lot of trouble.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:15.930
Master, the Calydonian Fleet
and the Azz-Azoth Fleet

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.180
along with two other fleets
are approaching Tauron.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:21.640
They're too eager for success...
We'll catch up with them, too!

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:24.100
I'll start the entry program.

00:11:26.860 --> 00:11:29.230
The time has come for us to invade Tauron...

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:33.450
Could it be that the Tribe of Silver
has abandoned the Tribe of Bronze?

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.330
So you're back.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:49.500
I've been thinking about our role.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:52.800
Rom Ror is planning to send Yuty out.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:56.340
Prome-sama already told me that.

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:58.470
So you knew about it.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.390
To the battle on the Planet Tauron

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:06.980
I'll go when Rom Ror figures out
the Tribe of Iron's next objective.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:10.230
So you're just going to let Tauron be destroyed.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:14.450
Why would I need to fight
for that planet anyway?

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:21.370
It's just an old planet where the old
Tribe of Bronze grows their larva.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:59.160
Atmospheric entry program activated!

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:04.250
Altitude 23000. The temperature
inside the aircraft is normal.

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:18.010
Shoot them! Keep on
shooting them! Shoot them all!

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:22.560
Give those ants a taste of
the same pain we suffered!

00:14:01.140 --> 00:14:04.180
The Tribe of Iron has occupied Tauron.

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.890
We knew that would happen all along.

00:14:06.980 --> 00:14:11.560
I wish to talk about the
Tribe of Iron once again.

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:16.860
The Tribe of Iron possesses characteristics that
are considered extremely rare in our universe.

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:19.320
They follow the oldest memories...

00:14:19.410 --> 00:14:25.580
even if they are of a planet and
a lineage that are useless now.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.040
Why is that?

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:32.000
I think that's because
those things are their core.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:33.710
Core...

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:37.840
How does that aid in the tribe's prosperity?

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:42.510
Most of the tribes constantly create new
bases and follow the genesis of planets

00:14:42.600 --> 00:14:49.480
and the expansion of starways,
just like the Tribe of Bronze and us.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:51.520
That is indeed prosperity.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.940
Most of the tribes want the newest things.

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:59.110
What will be the Tribe of Iron's next target?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:03.660
It's probably here,
our mother planet Codomos.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:07.120
It will be for the same
reason they invaded Tauron.

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:11.330
The fact that this planet is our birthplace.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.670
They will want this planet?

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:15.540
That is a meaningless act.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:20.670
Prome O, we wish to hear your thoughts.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.590
Thoughts about what, Rom Ror?

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.760
Is there any other tribe
other than the Tribe of Iron

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:31.350
that has achieved prosperity while
possessing such contradictory characteristics?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:33.100
Yes.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:39.480
Well, to be precise, there was a tribe in
space once which was very much like them.

00:15:39.570 --> 00:15:43.740
Which tribe was it?

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.450
The Tribe of Gold...

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.040
Synchronizing with the planetary orbit.

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:57.090
All Organ units finished deploying.

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:13.560
Age... What's the matter?

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.110
Age.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:31.200
Oh, no...

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.580
The flagship Althaia is sending us a request to
transition to the second phase of the operation.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:41.170
Captain, please tell all the fleets to stop
attacking the planet immediately.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:44.220
Wh-What do you mean by that, Princess?

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:47.390
There's no enemy here for us to fight.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:48.590
What?

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:53.600
This is no longer a fight.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.560
This is just a meaningless massacre...

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:13.450
Basically you're telling me that we've
been fighting against noncombatants?

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:17.960
Not all of them were noncombatants.
Not the ones that were in space.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:19.920
That doesn't make me feel any better!

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:29.720
We've burnt half of the planet to ashes...

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:33.060
What a sordid accomplishment this is...

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.750
We won... This is a big win for us!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:09.300
Th-This is indeed the pride of humanity!
The glory of the Federation fleet!

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:54.220
This is a great triumph!
Humanity's long-cherished wish,

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:58.640
the seizure of the Tribe of Bronze's
mother planet Tauron is now completed!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.980
Now is the time for us to
challenge the Tribe of Silver,

00:19:01.060 --> 00:19:04.900
which drove us to the
furthest reaches of the universe!

00:19:04.980 --> 00:19:12.070
That is the mission of humankind which
received the Nodos from the Tribe of Gold!

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:14.820
The time has come!
We, the Federation fleet,

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:18.370
will now invade the Tribe of
Silver's mother planet Codomos!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:24.380
Let's make history with this holy
war where justice is on our side!

00:19:32.010 --> 00:19:34.260
Like hell this was a victory.

00:19:34.340 --> 00:19:40.930
Your vitals are abnormal.
Hurry back and get some rest... Iolaous?

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:52.400
This entire planet was
a facility to raise larva...

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:56.910
They would have grown up
to be ferocious enemies.

00:19:56.990 --> 00:19:58.700
No matter which tribe they are,

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:03.750
it's unforgivable for us to
kill their young noncombatants!

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:09.500
The Tribe of Silver must've stopped considering
this place an important base a long time ago.

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:13.340
What do they consider their important bases?

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:18.260
Just like the princess said, we
have no clue about our own enemy.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:22.020
It is dangerous. No matter what
kind of strategy we come up with,

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:25.730
it may be meaningless as long as we
don't know anything about the enemy.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:27.650
Just like what happened in this incident.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:30.980
But we can no longer avoid fighting.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:33.820
Now it's come to this, we
have no choice but to hope

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:38.030
that invading the enemy's
Lebensraum wasn't a mistake in and of itself.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.330
Twelve agreements...

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:51.000
Conquer the Tribe of Bronze's mother planet...
the Tribe of Silver's mother planet...

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:56.380
The Tribe of Gold knew what we would want.

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:59.850
And they placed Age on our side...

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:07.230
Why? For what?

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:24.870
Sad, isn't it?

00:21:24.960 --> 00:21:26.580
Yeah.

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:30.630
I wonder how long this is going to last.

00:21:30.710 --> 00:21:34.710
I wonder if stuff like this
is going to repeat forever.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.090
It will come to an end.

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:41.800
Dad and the others said that
Dhianeila would put an end to it...

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:44.180
She would try to end it all.

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:46.770
That will be the real beginning.

00:21:46.850 --> 00:21:51.400
And Age and Belcross
were born for that reason.

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:53.770
Mehitak was, too...

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:57.150
Your dad and the others?

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:59.240
They raised Age.

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:03.280
Dhianeila calls them the Tribe of Gold.

00:22:03.370 --> 00:22:06.910
You were raised by the Tribe of Gold?

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:33.270
Zutto mae kara kimi no koto shitteita kedo

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:40.650
Konna kimochi mebaeru nante omowanakatta

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:46.240
Masaka kimi ni koi suru nante

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:56.920
Nanige nai kaerimichi
yozora no hoshi wo miage nagara

00:22:57.010 --> 00:23:09.600
Wazato toomawari shite
kimi no kata ni motarete aruku

00:23:09.680 --> 00:23:20.950
Futari de ireba donna kotodemo
norikoeraresou to iu kimi no

00:23:21.030 --> 00:23:26.240
Massugu na me wo mitsumete omou

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:32.750
Kimi wo aishiteru

00:23:35.880 --> 00:23:39.960
The Argonaut receives a new
order to head to the next battleground.

00:23:40.050 --> 00:23:44.640
Next time on Heroic Age, Episode 19:
"The Invasions Between the Star Systems."
